<title>UK: BayernVB sets 1.0 bln mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayernVB sets 1.0 bln mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank, Bayerische Vereinsbank, Commerzbank, Deutsche Morgan Grenfell, DG Bank and Dresdner Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK</p>
<p> AMT    1.0 BLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    28.JUL.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    =</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+3-4 BP</p>
<p> NOTES   ** TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    MUNICH    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  =	   FORCE MAJ   =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    11 BP     SELL CONC  19 BP     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND JULY 2004 BUND</p>
<p> NOTES	HYPOTHEKEN PFRANDBRIEF SERIES 661</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
